OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 79, admits causing death of
OL,4,Apedestrian
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 79-year-old man has admitted to
OL,7,Fcausing the death of a pedestrian.
OL,9,FBruce Drake of St Aldwyn Road,
OL,10,FGloucester, appeared at Cheltenham
OL,11,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday and
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to causing the death of
OL,13,FKieran Jones, 35, by
OL,14,Fcareless/inconsiderate driving.
OL,16,FJones was in collision with a Skoda
OL,17,Fshortly after 23:00 GMT on 14 January
OL,18,F2025 on Barton Street in Gloucester,
OL,19,Fnear to the junction with St James
OL,20,FStreet. He was taken to Southmead
OL,21,FHospital in Bristol in a serious
OL,22,Fcondition, and died three days later.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
